  "ai/npc/KetraOrcSupport/31372-04.html": {
   "file": "ai/npc/KetraOrcSupport/31372-04.html",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Soul Guide Asefa: Welcome, sworn friend of Ketra! I pray that the Flame of Paagrio will shed its light on your soul! The blood of the Varka Silenos you drew has been dedicated to the souls of our great ancestors in the midst of sacred flames in heaven! You'll receive the blessings of our ancestors!",
